## (A) Lumenora-authored material — MIT License

This section applies only to original material written by the Lumenora project, and only to the extent that the material is not copied from, derived from, or otherwise subject to a third-party license.

Subject to the statement above, this section applies to the following project-authored files and directories:

* BlueBuild recipe definitions:

  * `recipes/recipe.yml`
  * `recipes/recipe-nvidia.yml`
  * `recipes/recipe-nvidia-open.yml`
* Project-authored build scripts and configuration under:

  * `files/`
  * `scripts/`
* Project-authored desktop configuration and theme files, including:

  * the Lumen Plasma theme
  * MangoHud configuration
  * GameMode configuration
  * gamescope configuration
  * skel dotfiles
  * GPU-detection tooling under `files/usr/`
* `Containerfile`
* `installer/`
* GitHub Actions workflows under `.github/`

If any file in the list above contains third-party content, then the third-party content is excluded from this MIT grant and remains under its own license.

